WEBVTT

01:05.880 --> 01:07.240
Why is he so sure

01:07.240 --> 01:08.800
there's a gold mine here?

01:16.120 --> 01:17.080
What's wrong?

01:19.039 --> 01:19.800
Wine.

01:19.800 --> 01:20.760
Give me wine.

01:21.200 --> 01:21.960
Wine.

01:26.920 --> 01:27.680
Here.

01:42.000 --> 01:43.039
It's like being poisoned.

01:43.800 --> 01:45.400
or overused of exotic magic.

01:46.080 --> 01:46.840
Gold!

01:47.240 --> 01:49.360
We found gold.

01:52.400 --> 01:53.560
There really is gold.

01:55.200 --> 01:56.479
Is he a member of He Lian?

01:57.520 --> 01:59.120
But the HerLian family only knows how to find gold.

01:59.479 --> 02:00.600
They are not good at fighting.

02:01.520 --> 02:02.480
Who is he?

02:10.039 --> 02:12.320
Mother, don't go.

02:15.760 --> 02:16.960
Is it my fault?

02:17.680 --> 02:19.040
Why did you leave me?

02:23.000 --> 02:23.800
Why?

02:27.079 --> 02:27.880
Why?

02:38.360 --> 02:39.840
You make me look

02:39.840 --> 02:41.320
a heartless man.

02:54.240 --> 02:56.800
Ji Mingyue, don't be fooled by your appearance.

02:57.440 --> 02:58.960
Don't be fooled by his skin.

03:06.800 --> 03:10.280
His mother doesn't love him either?

03:14.200 --> 03:14.760
Cheers.

03:14.760 --> 03:15.680
Come on. Drink.

03:21.560 --> 03:22.280
Here.

03:22.640 --> 03:23.360
Fill it up.

03:27.320 --> 03:28.040
Cheers.

03:29.040 --> 03:29.840
Guys,

03:30.079 --> 03:31.400
I didn't treat you well before.

03:32.240 --> 03:33.680
I'll punish myself with three bowls of apology.

03:33.680 --> 03:35.520
I'll punish myself with six bowls.

03:37.560 --> 03:38.280
Cheers.

03:38.600 --> 03:39.960
Cheers.

03:40.120 --> 03:41.560
You finished the wine so soon?

03:41.560 --> 03:42.280
Fill it up.

03:42.280 --> 03:42.760
Again.

03:42.760 --> 03:43.720
Drink more.

03:43.720 --> 03:44.520
Okay.

03:46.400 --> 03:48.200
Brother, we

03:48.200 --> 03:50.840
really know each other.

03:50.840 --> 03:51.680
Here.

03:57.560 --> 03:58.280
Thank you.

04:00.840 --> 04:02.160
There are plenty of wine

04:02.920 --> 04:03.720
Come on.

04:04.240 --> 04:06.040
I’ll fill it up for you.

04:09.920 --> 04:11.040
Madam.

04:11.040 --> 04:12.760
Bad news, Madam.

04:14.760 --> 04:16.720
The North Army is coming.

04:20.839 --> 04:22.360
Second, take them away first.

04:22.680 --> 04:24.240
Yes, boss. Let's go.

04:25.240 --> 04:25.960
Go!

05:07.240 --> 05:08.240
Nine-head.

05:08.840 --> 05:10.160
If you win,

05:10.360 --> 05:13.040
you can get out of this dungeon.

05:14.280 --> 05:15.280
Zhao Jin.

05:15.760 --> 05:16.760
Zhao Jin.

05:17.400 --> 05:18.200
Wake up.

05:18.200 --> 05:19.000
Zhao Jin.

05:24.920 --> 05:26.360
Your body is cold and hot.

05:26.440 --> 05:27.760
Your pulse is inconsistent.

05:28.320 --> 05:29.320
It seems

05:29.320 --> 05:30.760
it doesn't seem that he has consumed too much magic.

05:31.200 --> 05:32.480
It seems that he was poisoned.

05:33.120 --> 05:34.720
Eldest Young Master. Eldest Young Master.

05:39.920 --> 05:41.080
Young Master, let’s go.

05:41.320 --> 05:42.120
The North Army is here.

05:42.760 --> 05:43.840
Let’s retreat.

05:45.560 --> 05:46.360
Second Master.

05:46.360 --> 05:48.360
Moo-yeol led the army.

05:48.360 --> 05:50.000
They don't accept our surrender.

05:50.000 --> 05:52.159
They are here to kill us.

05:52.680 --> 05:54.320
They were all arrested.

05:54.320 --> 05:57.520
They’ll kill them at noon.

05:58.520 --> 05:59.320
Hey, sister.

05:59.560 --> 06:00.560
You can't go.

06:00.560 --> 06:02.320
You'll die if you go.

06:03.800 --> 06:04.760
As far as I know,

06:05.000 --> 06:06.880
