06:07.520 --> 06:09.240
Baili Jinghong’s men came here

06:09.240 --> 06:10.280
to send troops without permission

06:10.800 --> 06:12.160
and violated the imperial taboo.

06:16.400 --> 06:18.680
It's true that the Northern Governor Chen

06:19.080 --> 06:21.240
But since Governor Chen, who devoted himself to the people,

06:21.480 --> 06:24.400
was executed by that demon queen,

06:25.080 --> 06:27.240
Mount Beigong became the territory of Baili Jinghong.

06:27.600 --> 06:29.360
This is all because of that demon queen.

06:32.440 --> 06:34.040
So Chen Hou

06:34.040 --> 06:35.480
is their governor.

06:38.280 --> 06:39.080
I’ll go have a look.

06:53.920 --> 06:56.040
The bandits and bandits

06:56.520 --> 06:58.120
Listen up.

07:01.880 --> 07:02.800
Come out now.

07:03.520 --> 07:04.320
Otherwise,

07:04.720 --> 07:06.560
I'll kill them all.

07:07.040 --> 07:08.120
Come out!

07:08.120 --> 07:09.000
Do you hear me?

07:10.800 --> 07:12.240
Come out now!

07:12.920 --> 07:14.520
Don't force me to do it.

07:15.160 --> 07:16.440
Anyone else?

07:16.440 --> 07:18.360
Come out!

07:25.920 --> 07:27.160
Brother.

07:27.160 --> 07:28.640
I'll kill them!

07:29.680 --> 07:32.800
Can you bear to see them all die here?

07:32.920 --> 07:34.360
Brother!

07:36.440 --> 07:37.360
Brother!

07:40.960 --> 07:41.880
Brother!

07:45.040 --> 07:46.640
Brother.

07:46.920 --> 07:48.120
Anyone else?

07:48.120 --> 07:49.280
Brother.

07:49.280 --> 07:51.240
I'll give you three seconds.

07:51.480 --> 07:53.200
When I count to three,

07:53.480 --> 07:55.120
If they still don't respond,

07:55.120 --> 07:58.120
I'll kill them all.

08:14.680 --> 08:15.480
Three.

08:22.280 --> 08:23.080
