08:28.200 --> 08:28.720
Young Master.

08:29.280 --> 08:30.280
You can't go out.

08:37.400 --> 08:39.039
Tell your lieutenant to come out.

08:39.320 --> 08:40.240
Who are you?

08:40.919 --> 08:42.120
How dare you be rude to our general!

08:44.560 --> 08:46.240
I'm Ji Mingyue.

08:46.920 --> 08:48.320
Inform Huo Ling Yu and the others.

08:48.640 --> 08:49.840
Tell them not to act rashly.

08:50.160 --> 08:50.760
Yes.

08:53.040 --> 08:53.840
Ji Mingyue.

08:57.240 --> 08:58.040
Ji...

08:59.160 --> 09:00.360
Empress Dowager.

09:00.960 --> 09:02.160
Bring me the portrait.

09:02.160 --> 09:02.960
Here.

09:06.680 --> 09:07.840
Your Majesty.

09:11.360 --> 09:12.880
Lieutenant General of the North.

09:12.960 --> 09:14.240
Greetings, Your Majesty.

09:14.560 --> 09:16.440
Greetings, Your Highness.

09:23.320 --> 09:24.120
Your Highness.

09:24.400 --> 09:25.440
General Baili.

09:25.440 --> 09:26.680
I’ve been looking for you.

09:26.680 --> 09:27.320
This way, please.

09:27.640 --> 09:28.800
I can go with you.

09:29.960 --> 09:30.880
Let them go.

09:32.400 --> 09:33.200
This...

09:34.320 --> 09:35.560
You are the demon queen.

09:35.880 --> 09:36.880
We don't need your help.

09:36.880 --> 09:38.280
Stop pretending to be kind.

09:38.400 --> 09:39.040
That's right.

09:39.400 --> 09:41.400
You're a scorpion who brings calamity to the country and the people.

09:41.400 --> 09:43.400
I curse you to go to hell after you die.

09:43.400 --> 09:44.640
You will die in hell

09:44.640 --> 09:45.640
and die a horrible death.

09:45.720 --> 09:47.120
Bah, dirty thing.

09:47.120 --> 09:48.920
We'd rather die than let you save him.

09:49.120 --> 09:49.960
You're so vicious.

09:50.400 --> 09:51.840
you'll die a miserable death.

09:52.320 --> 09:53.640
We don't need your help.

09:56.040 --> 09:57.400
Shut up!

09:57.560 --> 09:59.800
Or I'll kill you immediately.

10:00.040 --> 10:00.960
Just talk.

10:00.960 --> 10:02.080
Why did you hit me?

10:04.440 --> 10:05.440
Your Highness.

10:05.480 --> 10:07.680
You must be coming with me.

10:08.160 --> 10:09.080
The rest

10:09.440 --> 10:10.880
all of them.

10:10.880 --> 10:11.560
Kill!

10:13.200 --> 10:14.000
Stop!

10:15.760 --> 10:17.040
I promised to go with you.

10:17.320 --> 10:18.280
Why did you kill him?

10:18.280 --> 10:19.880
General Baili ordered

10:20.240 --> 10:21.400
Kill

10:21.760 --> 10:22.640
will be killed.

10:23.120 --> 10:23.840
Do it!

10:25.080 --> 10:26.160
Stop!

10:42.200 --> 10:43.200
Junior general.

10:46.960 --> 10:48.040
Greetings, young general.

10:51.680 --> 10:53.680
Greetings, young general.

11:01.000 --> 11:02.080
Zhao Jin.

11:02.640 --> 11:03.720
Nine-head.

11:04.840 --> 11:07.560
The young general who is famous under Baili Jinghong.

11:08.680 --> 11:09.760
Very good.

11:12.440 --> 11:13.160
Oh no.

11:13.560 --> 11:14.720
I knew I wasn't with him.

11:14.720 --> 11:15.840
he'll make trouble.

11:15.840 --> 11:16.960
Once he shows up,

11:16.960 --> 11:17.720
you must know

11:17.720 --> 11:19.960
the news we sent back to the North is fake.

11:20.960 --> 11:22.400
She has always been kind.

11:23.160 --> 11:24.800
There are too many misunderstandings about her.

11:25.960 --> 11:26.560
Mr. Huo,

11:26.920 --> 11:27.840
come with me.

11:28.520 --> 11:30.520
Our young master will save everyone.

11:33.400 --> 11:35.200
Junior general of the North, Jiu Ying.

11:36.000 --> 11:37.800
Of course he’s capable.

11:39.800 --> 11:40.680
Please lead the way.

11:50.840 --> 11:51.640
Brother.

11:55.720 --> 11:56.440
Man.

11:56.880 --> 11:57.920
Why are you here?

11:59.320 --> 12:00.320
You've grown taller.

12:00.680 --> 12:01.200
Yes.

12:02.880 --> 12:04.840
Man, come here.

12:04.840 --> 12:06.040
Does father know?

12:07.800 --> 12:08.720
He knows.

12:09.440 --> 12:10.720
He misses you.

12:12.280 --> 12:13.640
You're the only one who misses me.

12:14.120 --> 12:15.320
How could he miss me?

12:16.600 --> 12:17.480
Brother.

12:18.000 --> 12:20.000
You went to save those bandits for Empress Dowager.

12:20.000 --> 12:22.200
I will punish you if I know.

12:22.360 --> 12:23.160
It doesn’t matter.

12:23.520 --> 12:24.720
I will bear

12:24.720 --> 12:26.160
