12:27.920 --> 12:28.880
Brother.

12:30.000 --> 12:31.760
You seem to care about her.

12:37.520 --> 12:38.480
You like her.

12:42.400 --> 12:43.080
Yes.

12:44.080 --> 12:45.000
I do like her.

12:50.680 --> 12:51.920
You have good taste.

12:52.200 --> 12:54.280
Your Highness, you are so beautiful.

12:54.400 --> 12:55.200
Man.

12:56.000 --> 12:56.960
My identity.

12:57.160 --> 12:58.040
Don’t worry.

12:58.560 --> 13:00.560
I know you don’t want Baili Jinghong to know

13:00.560 --> 13:01.640
your identity.

13:02.720 --> 13:04.200
will not be exposed.

13:04.800 --> 13:06.320
or put you in danger.

13:06.680 --> 13:07.600
Don't worry, brother.

13:08.920 --> 13:09.880
It's been a few days.

13:09.880 --> 13:11.240
My Man has grown up.

13:12.760 --> 13:13.800
Of course he will.

13:16.280 --> 13:17.520
Junior general, please.

13:18.240 --> 13:19.040
Please.

13:36.800 --> 13:39.360
This is the woman in his study.

13:39.760 --> 13:40.640
Right?

13:40.640 --> 13:41.320
Yes.

13:41.680 --> 13:43.080
I saw her

13:43.080 --> 13:45.640
in Eldest Young Master’s place.

13:46.360 --> 13:47.560
A man in the painting.

13:48.360 --> 13:50.560
You only met her a few times,

13:50.560 --> 13:51.720
and you fell in love with her.

13:53.200 --> 13:54.640
For her,

13:54.640 --> 13:56.400
for her.

13:58.520 --> 14:00.000
They are inhumane.

14:00.480 --> 14:02.760
Why don't they bring us food?

14:03.360 --> 14:04.480
I'm starving.

14:04.480 --> 14:06.120
I'm so hungry.

14:06.640 --> 14:08.560
Brother, take a rest.

14:09.520 --> 14:10.920
Bring them some food too.

14:19.120 --> 14:20.720
Your Highness, there's something you don't know.

14:21.240 --> 14:22.360
the rules in the army

14:22.640 --> 14:25.120
Prisoners need to starve for three days.

14:26.120 --> 14:26.840
Besides,

14:27.080 --> 14:30.120
these people will die sooner or later.

14:30.760 --> 14:31.720
Don't waste

14:31.920 --> 14:33.240
Don't waste them.

14:39.840 --> 14:41.080
Then don't eat it.

14:41.400 --> 14:42.560
Who are you?

14:42.960 --> 14:44.400
Who are you to answer me?

14:46.360 --> 14:48.040
I'm asking the young general.

14:54.840 --> 14:56.160
Bring them food.

14:59.680 --> 15:00.520
Here.

15:01.000 --> 15:02.240
Serve them some food.

15:02.840 --> 15:03.400
Yes.

15:06.240 --> 15:07.560
This woman

15:08.560 --> 15:10.000
is too arrogant.

15:10.280 --> 15:12.760
The new emperor is secretly looking for her.

15:13.080 --> 15:15.200
Baili Jinghong is also after her.

15:15.400 --> 15:18.400
This woman must have a big secret

15:18.640 --> 15:20.120
or very useful.

15:20.520 --> 15:21.440
Oh.

15:22.560 --> 15:23.680
Really?

15:26.640 --> 15:29.520
Don't make it difficult for me.

15:29.520 --> 15:30.600
Before we deployed,

15:30.600 --> 15:32.000
General told me

15:32.360 --> 15:33.560
no one

15:33.960 --> 15:35.000
must be killed.

15:38.040 --> 15:39.600
We need a lot of people to dig the mine.

15:39.920 --> 15:41.080
Instead of killing them all,

15:41.880 --> 15:42.880
than kill them all.

15:44.360 --> 15:45.240
General.

15:45.720 --> 15:47.480
Maybe he doesn't know about the situation of Mount Beili.

15:48.240 --> 15:49.120
He thought

15:49.120 --> 15:50.880
a bunch of bandits who are undisciplined.

15:51.480 --> 15:52.360
But as you can see,

15:52.560 --> 15:53.720
they have no ability to resist.

15:54.440 --> 15:55.120
right?

15:56.480 --> 15:59.320
Junior general is right.

16:02.240 --> 16:03.760
Thank you for your advice.

16:07.320 --> 16:08.480
It seems

16:08.480 --> 16:12.240
the young general has a close relationship with the Empress Dowager.

16:29.720 --> 16:30.960
Your Highness.

16:31.640 --> 16:34.520
Why are you with these prisoners?

16:35.120 --> 16:36.360
You've done a lot.

16:36.960 --> 16:38.160
But they

16:38.760 --> 16:40.680
don't seem to appreciate it.

16:46.920 --> 16:47.880
Who are you?

16:49.840 --> 16:52.320
I'm the young master of the Helian Clan, He Lian Zheng.

16:53.120 --> 16:56.080
I’m here to tell you a secret.

16:57.720 --> 16:59.920
about your real identity

17:00.760 --> 17:02.640
and your real identity.

17:06.800 --> 17:08.560
Why don't you come with me?

17:09.200 --> 17:10.520
Before we go to the North,

17:10.960 --> 17:13.280
before we go to the North?

17:14.960 --> 17:16.680
If they stay here,

17:17.040 --> 17:18.319
if they stay here.

17:22.119 --> 17:22.560
Sure.

17:23.720 --> 17:24.440
But...

17:25.319 --> 17:26.839
